# Attributes here apply to everything under artifacts/ at any depth
# (patterns with no "/" match at any level below this file's directory --
# same rule as .gitignore; see https://git-scm.com/docs/gitattributes).
#
# Pin the tracked text files under artifacts/ to LF on checkout, regardless
# of a contributor's local core.autocrlf. Without this, a Windows checkout
# (core.autocrlf=true, the Git-for-Windows default) renders these files as
# CRLF while every tool that generates or compares them (Node's fs.writeFile,
# JSON.stringify + "\n") emits LF -- that mismatch was producing pure
# line-ending diffs with zero semantic content on every test run (defect
# F-32eed6ee, most visibly on artifacts/direct-rail/*.json, the governance
# golden-path files).
*.json text eol=lf
*.ts text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
